When the title of “Royal Cupid” is mistakenly given to you, a normal mortal, the kingdom’s matchmaking troubles are thrust upon your shoulders. Wars or alliances, enemies or lovers, so much can arise from one well- or un-planned date!
This is a point-and-click game with visual novel elements. Music was made using virtual instruments in Bandlab.

You can play the demo of this on ithc.io which we made during a gamejam.
